OL,3,GNEWSAWomen left terrified as jewellery
OL,4,Asnatched in masked robberies
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the moment she was attacked, Eve
OL,7,Fsaid her life changed: "When he robbed
OL,8,Fme, he took a lot more than my gold
OL,9,Fchains off me. He took the person that
OL,10,FI was."
OL,12,FThe 78-year-old grandmother was getting
OL,13,Fin her car one evening in April when a
OL,14,Fmasked man grabbed her arm, stole her
OL,15,Fbracelets and ran off.
OL,17,F"That shock, it lives with me, that
OL,18,Fimage," she admitted, adding the
OL,19,Frobbery had a massive effect on her.
