OL,3,GNEWSAWomen left terrified as jewellery
OL,4,Asnatched in masked robberies
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's got worse as the days have gone
OL,7,Fby. I have to make sure the windows are
OL,8,Fshut in case anyone gets in while I'm
OL,9,Fin the room, and I'm frightened to
OL,10,Fanswer the door to anyone.
